      "created_at": "2013-09-30T15:59:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, here is my question:&nbsp; If a card tells you to search the deck for a specific type of card, but there are none of that type in your deck, do you shuffle in the trash to meet the requirements?&nbsp; What about if the wording of the card says to reveal cards from the deck?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For instance, the Operative says to reveal cards&nbsp;from the villain deck until you find an Underboss.&nbsp; If all the Underbosses are in play or in the trash, do you shuffle the trash into the villain deck and keep going till you get an Underboss?</p><p>Also,</p><p>Omnitron-X has&nbsp;the card Technological Advancement which says to search the deck for a plating or component card.&nbsp; If all component and plating cards are in the trash or in play, do you shuffle in the trash?&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:19.964Z",
