      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-09-30T16:01:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The deck will only be shuffled when said deck is empty and a card needs to be drawn or discarded from the top of said deck. Reveal and search effects have no effect, even if the deck is empty.</p>",
