      "created_at": "2013-09-30T16:09:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That's actually a viable technique, especially with Plague Rat. You can wait out for him to get rid of all his Infections before curing yourself and bashing on him; with all his Infection cards in the trash, he won't be able to infect anyone again until he reshuffles, even if he plays a card that says \"Search for Infection and play it.\" :D</p>",
